   "lines": [
    "West and I started",
    "on horseback for",
    "Lake Ronkonkoma.",
    "The day was cool",
    "and cloudy. Started",
    "8.00 a.m; reached",
    "Smithtown 10.45 a.m,",
    "took lunch, and in",
    "afternoon rode to",
    "the lake where we",
    "took supper, and",
    "returned to sleep",
    "at Smithtown. In",
    "all about 35 miles,",
    "and the horse as",
    "fresh as when he",
    "started."
   ],
